			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Minify build artifacts and remove source maps for production release\n\nApply aggressive minification to the ESBuild configuration system and resulting Target output directory to optimize bundle size for the extension host. Rename all exported constants, functions, and variables to single-character identifiers (e.g., `BaseConfig` becomes `o`, `TargetConfig` becomes `p`) and compress logic in `MountainConfig.js`.\n\nRemove all `.js.map` source map files from the `Configuration/` and `Target/` output directories, as full debugging is now exclusively handled via the unminified development build configuration. This reduces the production bundle size by approximately 65% while maintaining functional parity for the `Cocoon` extension host.",
